Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.08,0:00:44.75,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5}Ocultos na minha mão esquerda
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.75,0:00:47.97,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5}Meus desejos permanecem não realizados
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.97,0:00:52.68,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,880)\blur7.5}Presos em um sonho sem fim
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.13,0:00:55.97,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5}Ocultas na minha mão direita
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.97,0:00:59.18,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5}Minhas memórias vazias continuam invisíveis a todos
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.18,0:01:04.90,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5}Sendo açoitadas por uma chuva sem fim
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.90,0:01:11.05,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,540)\blur7.5}Seja a força para proteger o que é precioso
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.28,0:01:15.55,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5}Ou a fraqueza de perder a fé nisso
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.55,0:01:18.22,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,280)\blur7.5}Aceitarei tudo isso
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.49,0:01:20.99,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,480)\blur7.5}E buscarei um novo amanhecer
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.75,0:01:29.36,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,780)\blur7.5}Ao estender a mão, vejo a luz
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.36,0:01:34.61,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,780)\blur7.5}Mesmo em farrapos, você salva a minha vida
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.76,0:01:38.43,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,0)\blur7.5}Todos os sentimentos depositados na ponta
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.43,0:01:40.93,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5}Da lâmina erguida aos céus
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.93,0:01:48.38,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(290,1080)\blur7.5}Uma prece que transcende o tempo
